<title>PORTUGAL: SOCCER-PORTUGAL AND GERMANY DRAW 0-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER. [CORRECTED 14:16 GMT 15/12]</title>
<headline>SOCCER-PORTUGAL AND GERMANY DRAW 0-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER. [CORRECTED 14:16 GMT 15/12]</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-12-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects Group 9 standings table.)</p>
<p>Portugal and Germany drew 0-0 in a World Cup European group nine qualifier in Lisbon on Saturday.</p>
<p>Attendance: 50,000  </p>
<p>Group 9 standings (tabulate under - played, won, drawn,</p>
<p>lost, goals for, against, points):</p>
<p> Portugal	     5   2   2   1   5   2   8</p>
<p> Ukraine		3   2   0   1   3   2   6</p>
<p> Germany		3   1   2   0   6   2   5</p>
<p> Northern Ireland   4   1   2   1   4   3   5</p>
<p> Armenia		4   0   3   1   3   7   3</p>
<p> Albania		2   0   1   2   1   6   1</p>
